       TemplateBox[{
        "\"Figure 1. Eulerian energy density of an Alcubierre bubble (v=c, \
R=1, \[Sigma]=8) as a 3D surface.  Two depressions in the bubble wall \
\[LongDash] one in front of the ship, one behind \[LongDash] is where the \
exotic matter (\[Rho] < 0) must live.  Click-and-drag to rotate in a live \
Mathematica session.\""},
        "RowDefault"],
       StripOnInput->False,
