    {
     PaneBox[
      StyleBox[
       TemplateBox[{
        "\"Figure 2. Expansion scalar \[Theta] of Eulerian observers around \
an Alcubierre bubble.  Red = space contracting (front of bubble, \[Theta]<0), \
blue = space expanding (back of bubble, \[Theta]>0); the RedBlueTones colour \
function maps low values to red and high values to blue.  The y-z plane \
through the centre is exactly neutral.\""},
        "RowDefault"],
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontFamily->"Helvetica",
       FontSize->10,
       FontSlant->Italic],
      Alignment->Center,
      ImageSize->720]}
   },
   DefaultBaseStyle->"Column",
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}},
   GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{0.6}}}],
  "Column"]], "Output",
 CellMargins->{{20, 20}, {10, 14}},
 ShowCellLabel->False,
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"7a1941df-30b1-4690-9c1c-5a3dd846ac10"],

Cell["\<\
So if you stand inside the bubble and look out the front porthole, distant \
galaxies appear to be rushing towards you; look out the back, they're racing \
away.  The bubble itself \"surfs\" forward on its own private patch of \
contracting space.  This is the qualitative picture you'll have heard \
described in popular accounts \[LongDash] and the picture above is its actual \
mathematical content.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f73292c3-de3d-40a4-936e-b6158487f6db"],

Cell["5. The bubble in motion", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"cbcb7010-6cdc-4ca7-9b62-fbbf28adb967"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "All of the above is for a bubble centred at the origin.  Plug in time and \
the centre advects at uniform velocity ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["v", "s"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "9839f6d0-3845-416b-88f6-dbd930baedcd"],
 ".  Animated, this gives the canonical \"warp drive\" image: a moving \
capsule of warped geometry, exotic-matter wall and all:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"78864f6d-0105-4230-9c09-d6f3972fd0c6"],

Cell["\<\
frames = Table[
  Show[
    DensityPlot[
      AlcubierreAnalyticEnergyDensity[{1, 1, 8}, {t, x, y, 0}],
      {x, -3.5, 5.5}, {y, -2, 2}, PlotPoints -> 130,
      ColorFunction -> \"TemperatureMap\", Frame -> True],
    Graphics[{Black, Thick, Circle[{1.0 t, 0}, 1.0]}]],
  {t, 0, 4, 4/29.}];
ListAnimate[frames]\
\>", "Input",
 CellTags->"runnable",ExpressionUUID->"f6e3584c-5730-42d2-a825-cafbbb7028c0"],

